    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>ARM36 node-3：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>[    0.000000] Kernel command line: BOOT_IMAGE=(lvmid/ukmXfo-FFSb-xooF-zalI-txDi-woa4-0umXc3/RzW85A-9giM-CbRN-u1aH-dgQx-ASCM-KhcnC5)/boot/vmlinuz-6.6.0-85.0.0.79.es9_5.aarch64 root=/dev/mapper/os-root ro transparent_hugepage=never cgroup.memory=nokmem iommu.passthrough=1 ixgbe.allow_unsupported_sfp=1 biosdevname=0 rootdelay=90 nomodeset intel_idle.max_cstate=0 processor.max_cstate=0 crashkernel=736M rd.lvm.lv=os/root net.ifnames=1 console=tty0 usbcore.usb_rb_enable=0 slub_debug isolcpus=80 scsi_logging_level=-1 memmap=128G@0x204000000000 log_buf_len=8M
[    0.000000] Booted with the nomodeset parameter. Only the system framebuffer will be available
[    0.000000] Unknown kernel command line parameters "BOOT_IMAGE=(lvmid/ukmXfo-FFSb-xooF-zalI-txDi-woa4-0umXc3/RzW85A-9giM-CbRN-u1aH-dgQx-ASCM-KhcnC5)/boot/vmlinuz-6.6.0-85.0.0.79.es9_5.aarch64 biosdevname=0 scsi_logging_level=-1", will be passed to user space.
[    0.000000] printk: log_buf_len: 8388608 byte</pre>
</div></div>

<p>X86 cd：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>...
Jul 02 19:42:51 node-1.domain.tld kernel: Kernel command line: BOOT_IMAGE=(hd0,gpt3)/vmlinuz-6.6.0-85.0.0.79.es9_7.x86_64 root=/dev/mapper/os-root ro edd=off kvm.halt_poll_ns=400000 cgroup.memory=nokmem intel_iommu=on iommu=pt pci=realloc ixgbe.allow_unsupported_sfp=1 tsx=on rootdelay=90 nomodeset intel_idle.max_cstate=0 processor.max_cstate=0 crashkernel=736M rd.lvm.lv=os/root biosdevname=0 net.ifnames=1 selinux=0
Jul 02 19:42:51 node-1.domain.tld kernel: DMAR: IOMMU enabled
Jul 02 19:42:51 node-1.domain.tld kernel: Booted with the nomodeset parameter. Only the system framebuffer will be available
Jul 02 19:42:51 node-1.domain.tld kernel: Unknown kernel command line parameters "BOOT_IMAGE=(hd0,gpt3)/vmlinuz-6.6.0-85.0.0.79.es9_7.x86_64 edd=off tsx=on biosdevname=0", will be passed to user space.
Jul 02 19:42:51 node-1.domain.tld kernel: random: crng init done
...</pre>
</div></div>

<ol>
	<li>需要看下这些参数之前是哪些问题引入的，高版本内核是否已经将参数舍弃。</li>
	<li>确认下这些参数所在问题在631上是否还存在，是否需要解决。</li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
